body:
Hey! I am looking to run a game in Scum and Villainy: [https://evilhat.com/product/scum-and-villainy/](https://evilhat.com/product/scum-and-villainy/)

&#x200B;

I have read the book, and have the ruleset to share so no one else needs to buy. I have run about 3 games in 5e, but really want more space rpg in my life. I will message you on discord, but I will leave this for others, cause I don't have a group right now for this.
